            "_key": "a2-14",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "These ranges come from published UK agency pricing and our own client data. Of 14 clients who came to us with a WordPress site to rebuild, 12 had spent more on WordPress over the previous two to three years than a new custom site would have cost them outright. The monthly figures are small enough to ignore one at a time, which is exactly why they add up."
